fixture zone1_10_crouch_dash_under
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 10 "Crouch-dash under: crouch, then dash, keeps the 28-tall hitbox. Taught by a low gap"; zone 1 room 10: the teaching route. Run from the west arrival to gap A (32 u tall, 64 long, safe), crouch-dash through it, run to gap B (128 long), crouch-dash through that, jump the pit and cross the east door
room zone1/10_crouch_dash_under
spawn 74 960
frames 210
input
  0..37 R
  # Down-forward and dash at gap A (x 448..512): crouched, the dash keeps the 28 u box.
  38 D R dash
  39..87 R
  # The same at gap B (x 960..1056), from just before its face (x 950).
  88 D R dash
  89..118 R
  # Off the landing and over the pit (x 1344..1504).
  119 R jump
  120..209 R
end
expect
  at 38 event.dash=1 state=dash height=28
  at 42 x>480u x<500u state=dash height=28
  never 38..46 hit_wall=1
  at 88 event.dash=1 state=dash height=28
  at 92 x>1000u x<1070u state=dash height=28
  never 88..100 hit_wall=1
  # Out of B the body stands.
  mark stand 90..110 height=44
  at stand x>1056u
  never 0..209 event.hazard=1
  mark through 110..209 event.room=1
  at through room=zone1_11_ember_toss_cancel x=74u
end
